WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0100: no BG3 effects are replayed at camp.

Going to camp crashed benilla: a GPU page fault on a shader's data read, about the moment three new effect
pipelines were built for BG3's frames there (log: "at camp: the interface alone", then the device lost). The fault
is not traced to one draw, this takes the whole replay away while only the interface is drawn.

diff --git a/crates/benilla-app/src/wowbg3_fx_render.rs b/crates/benilla-app/src/wowbg3_fx_render.rs
--- a/crates/benilla-app/src/wowbg3_fx_render.rs
+++ b/crates/benilla-app/src/wowbg3_fx_render.rs
@@ -2073,7 +2073,8 @@
     recv: Option<Res<FxReceivers>>,
 ) {
     let gpu = &mut *gpu;
-    let set = ext.and_then(|e| e.set.clone());
+    // Patch 0100: at camp only the interface is wanted, and BG3's camp arrival replayed here took the GPU down.
+    let set = ext.and_then(|e| e.set.clone()).filter(|_| !crate::wowbg3_frames::at_camp());
     let (Some(set), Ok((view, target))) = (set, views.single()) else {
         gpu.ready = None;
         gpu.last = None;
diff --git a/crates/benilla-app/src/wowbg3_frames.rs b/crates/benilla-app/src/wowbg3_frames.rs
